Package: com.551.dndicon16
Name: DND Icon 16
Version: 1.0.0
Architecture: iphoneos-arm64
Description: Shows a customisable moon-and-cloud Do Not Disturb symbol on the Home Screen only while the built-in Do Not Disturb Focus is enabled. Includes colour and position controls.
